// Palier 3 (y 0-24): dry meadow, the stone portal north (x 18-21), the brambles (5-6, 13) over the
//   shortcut ravine (x 5-6, ledge at y 25), the braises nook (x 29-35, y 4-9) behind the cracked
//   rock (31, 10, an object), the pool (30-33, 22-24) on top of waterfall 3.
// Palier 2 (y 30-55): the river, the west bank and its pontoon (9-12, 36), the west islet
//   (7-10, 42-44), the Rocher du Poeme islet (24-27, 40-42), the east bank (31-36, 44-54).
// Cliff band y 56-60: waterfall 2 (x 16-18, the 'paradoxal' one, drawn as a normal fall down
//   into the pocket basin) and waterfall 1 (x 27-30, up from the lake).
// Palier 1 (y 61-79): the lake, its banks, the pocket basin (14-20, 61-63) and recess (15-19,
//   64-65). The south entrance (x 18-21, y 78-79) is forest until Reverse-City (Ch7) links.
// The portal's edge cells (18-21, 0) are General's grass: Evalon (General + SilEvalon) walks onto
//   them with its own tilesets (the connection seam), so they stay primary.
